field.comment:
Only used when Delivery Channel = Feishu. Markdown is supported (lark_md): **bold**, [text](url).
Available variables:
{{product_name}} {{product_sku}} {{product_url}} {{product_rating}} {{rating}}
{{review_title}} {{review_detail}} {{status}} {{status_label}}
{{nickname}} {{review_id}} {{created_at}} {{admin_url}} {{store_code}}

{{rating}} is this review's overall score (average of its rating dimensions, e.g. 4.7).
{{product_rating}} is the product's aggregate rating (e.g. 4.5).
{{status_label}} is human readable (Pending moderation / Approved / Not approved).
{{admin_url}} is also rendered as an "Open in admin" button below the card body.
